/*debug_bitmap:
 1 Token printing
 2 Print strings
 4 Comment printing
 8 if clauses
 16  jump -> GOTO, REPEAT, Labels
 32   stack debug
 64   activate label_finder msgs
 128  hashmap after executing file & modifications
*/
